          "from": "Proto-Berber *a-ǵadir 'wall'",
          "to": "ajdir 'cliff, slope, ravine'"
        },
        {
          "from": "Proto-Berber *a-ǵăḍiḍ 'bird'",
          "to": "ajḍiḍ"
        },
        {
          "from": "Proto-Berber *e-ǵăʔdăr 'eagle'",
          "to": "jidar"
        },
        {
          "from": "Proto-Berber *ămǵər 'to harvest'",
          "to": "mjar"
        },
        {
          "from": "Proto-Berber *ăǵən 'to lie down, sleep'",
          "to": "jen",
          "note": "Riffian ⟨j⟩ = [ʒ]; plain *g instead gives y [j] in Riffian (aryaz 'man'), so the two velars stay apart. Kabyle and Tashelhit have g in these words (agadir, igider, mger, gen)."
        }
      ]
    },
